{"turn_id": "d01-t1", "session_id": "d01", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "bls_data_source", "text": "作者使用美国劳工统计局（U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics）的数据，考察各职业中女性参与的比例，并将翻译中的女性代词频率与该数据进行比较。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "real_world_distribution_comparison", "text": "作者确实考察了女性工作者的现实分布，并发现谷歌翻译的输出未能反映女性工作者的真实分布，其女性代词分布与女性参与数据呈反向分布。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}, {"key": "no_correlation", "text": "作者将女性工作者的分布与女性翻译的频率进行比较，发现两者之间没有相关性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "data_scope_united_states", "text": "所使用的女性参与数据来自美国劳工统计局及美国劳工部妇女局，而非来自使用性别中立语言的国家。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-d56cdc01d43cd2975b96cb5f"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d01-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d01-t2", "session_id": "d01", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "bls_female_participation", "text": "作者使用了美国劳工统计局（BLS）详细职业表中的数据，该表提供了所列职业中女性参与的百分比；作者将翻译统计结果与此BLS数据对照，以考察现实中的女性工作者分布。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-d56cdc01d43cd2975b96cb5f"}]}, {"key": "gt_fails_real_distribution", "text": "作者称其将Google Translate的性别代词统计与BLS各职业女性参与频率数据对照后，表明Google Translate未能再现现实世界中女性工作者的分布（GT fails to reproduce a real-world distribution of female workers）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}, {"key": "male_defaults_vs_demographics", "text": "作者提供实验证据表明，即便原则上不应预期50:50的代词性别分布，Google Translate产生男性默认值的频率也远高于仅凭人口统计数据所能预期的水平。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}, {"key": "method_gender_neutral_languages", "text": "作者的方法是把在性别中立语言（如匈牙利语、中文、约鲁巴语等12种语言）中构造的句子经Google Translate API译为英语，并统计译文中女性、男性及性别中立代词出现的频率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-d56cdc01d43cd2975b96cb5f"}]}, {"key": "stem_male_default", "text": "论文显示Google Translate表现出强烈的男性默认倾向，尤其是对STEM等性别分布不平衡的领域。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}, {"key": "stereotype_examples", "text": "文中举例说明，关于刻板性别角色的句子很可能被相应地翻译：nurse和baker被译为女性代词，而engineer和CEO被译为男性代词。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-10f671efdbe25a3af88930ca"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d01-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d01-t3", "session_id": "d01", "turn": 3, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "gender_bias_examines_real_world_female_distribution", "text": "Assessing Gender Bias in Machine Translation 将 Google Translate 的输出与 BLS（美国劳工统计局）数据中女性在各职业的参与频率进行对比，发现二者无相关性，说明 Google Translate 输出未能反映真实世界中女性工作者的分布。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "gender_bias_basis_is_us_bls", "text": "该论文使用的现实分布参照是美国劳工统计局的职业数据（含各职业女性参与百分比），而非性别中立语言所在国家的工作者分布。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-d56cdc01d43cd2975b96cb5f"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "gender_bias_hypothesis_not_twitter", "text": "该论文提出的假设是统计翻译工具可用来探测社会中刻板的性别角色（或至少是其训练数据中的性别角色），并未提出关于 Twitter 数据为何能更好预测各国语言使用清单的假设。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-b6caead3073704c5fbf5e230"}]}, {"key": "mapping_languages_twitter_prediction", "text": "Mapping Languages and Demographics with Georeferenced Corpora 在摘要中指出 Twitter 数据对每个国家所用语言清单的预测更好。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2004.00809", "chunk_id": "c-204aa49abd2af324ac170d44"}]}, {"key": "mapping_languages_no_female_worker_distribution", "text": "在提供的证据中，Mapping Languages and Demographics with Georeferenced Corpora 以人口普查与语言普查数据为对照评估地理参照语料，未提及考察女性工作者的现实分布。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2004.00809", "chunk_id": "c-204aa49abd2af324ac170d44"}]}, {"key": "comparability_by_question", "text": "两篇论文研究对象不同（前者为机器翻译性别偏误，后者为地理参照语料对人口与语言的代表性），因此在“女性工作者现实分布”与“Twitter 预测语言清单的假设”这两个具体问题上不具备直接可比性：前者仅就美国 BLS 职业数据讨论女性分布，后者证据中未涉及该分布，也未就 Twitter 预测优势给出假设。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}, {"paper_id": "2004.00809", "chunk_id": "c-204aa49abd2af324ac170d44"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d01-t3", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
